# What of backend/ is NOT sent to the API image build (api.Dockerfile). BuildKit uses this file
# instead of any .dockerignore in backend/, so DevOps owns it.

# Environments and caches: dependencies are installed inside the image
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache

# Local env files: never baked into an image (settings come from compose / the environment)
**/.env*

# Tests are not part of the runtime image
**/tests

# OS files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
